<title>JAPAN: Omron - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Omron - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		188.66		vs	  190.39</p>
<p> Operating	    7.68		vs	    7.33</p>
<p> Current		7.13		vs	    7.52</p>
<p> Net		    4.36		vs	    3.99</p>
<p> EPS		   16.65 yen	  vs	   15.23 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    262 million	  vs	 262 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.60 yen	  vs	    6.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Omron Corp is a top maker of control components.</p>
